# Arena map scaffolding

## Rojo (macOS live sync)

Arena `.project.json` files **must live at repo root** with `"$path": "src/..."` only.
Never use `maps/<id>.project.json` with `"../src/..."` — Rojo 7.5.1 on macOS will not sync `.luau` edits (only JSON changes reload). See [rojo#1200](https://github.com/rojo-rbx/rojo/issues/1200).

## Naming

Folder id = Lua map id = `ActiveMapId` StringValue. Exception: Fish Frenzy folder is `fish_frenzy` but map id is `main`.

## Two templates

- **Rojo tree:** copy `king_of_the_jungle.project.json` (ActiveMapId, mount pattern)
- **Gameplay scripts:** copy `src/places/fish_frenzy/` (water_template baseline)

## Per-map checklist

1. `<map_id>.project.json` at root — unique `servePort`, `placeId`, `ActiveMapId`, paths to `src/places/<map_id>/`
2. `src/places/<map_id>/server/WaterSplashSpawner.server.luau` — PlaceId guard, map id strings
3. `src/places/<map_id>/client/SplashKillFishVfx.client.luau` — per-map VFX
4. `src/shared/MatchMaps.luau` — set real `placeId` (lobby grid is data-driven, no lobby UI edits)
5. `src/shared/MatchSplashConfig.luau` — `byMapId` entry
6. `src/shared/SplashFishCatalog.luau` — fish tier tables

## Do not copy per map

`src/server`, `src/arena/client`, bulk of `src/shared`.

## Ports

34872 lobby · 34873 Fish Frenzy · 34874 battlegrounds · 34875 jungle · **34876–34880 next maps**

## Place scripts

Always guard: `if game.PlaceId ~= EXPECTED_PLACE_ID then return end`.
Always set `ActiveMapId` in project JSON (`SplashKillFishFrames` reads StringValue, not PlaceId).
